    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Store the association between particles and the classes which manage their states. I&apos;m not a huge fan of having this class, but I haven&apos;t thought of a better way to store the information that is easily exposed to Python and gets to all the right places. It is initialized internally in the <ref refid="classIMP_1_1domino_1_1DominoSampler" kindref="compound">DominoSampler</ref>. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
